<title>NETHERLANDS: Polydoc loss widens in 1996.</title>
<headline>Polydoc loss widens in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of stg unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss per shr (pence)	   3.6  vs   1.9</p>
<p>    Net loss				 0.54  vs  0.26</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		625    vs 736</p>
<p>NOTE - Software firm Polydoc was floated on the New Market of the Amsterdam Stock Exchange last March. It was already listed on London's Alternative Investment Market. The company said in March it expected a 1996 loss of less than 0.5 million stg but added 1997 prospects were positive. Polydoc said the improvement was seen taking place in the 2nd half of the year.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
